# The secret: half an hour with nobody touching it and the fireflies come out. The scene fills the
# screen, they flash with the leaves; a touch (here a key) only wakes the screen: the scale stays.
wait 4000
expect flies 0
wait 1795000
expect flies 0
wait 10000
expect flies >0
wait 40000
expect flies >10
shot flies.png
leds
tapkey w2
wait 300
expect flies 0
shot back.png
wait 1000
expect flies 0
